From d9a650985db894b779855553067b921f8f9b971e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 23:34:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/36] Make every non-legendary Pokemon obtainable

- tools/hack/encounters.py places ~130 species in thematic FireRed tables,
  taking slots only from common species, and verifies all 386 are obtainable
- Altering Cave holds all of its Mystery Gift species
- Evolution items (incl. Deep Sea Tooth/Scale) sold at Celadon 4F
- No National Dex lock on evolutions

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
---
 .../scripts.inc                               |   8 +
 src/data/items.json                           |  12 +-
 src/data/wild_encounters.json                 | 342 +++++++++---------
 src/evolution_scene.c                         |   6 +-
 src/party_menu.c                              |   3 +-
 tools/hack/encounters.py                      | 321 ++++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 512 insertions(+), 180 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tools/hack/encounters.py

diff --git a/data/maps/CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_4F/scripts.inc b/data/maps/CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_4F/scripts.inc
index 98069ca..850f3df 100644
--- a/data/maps/CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_4F/scripts.inc
+++ b/data/maps/CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_4F/scripts.inc
@@ -32,6 +32,14 @@ CeladonCity_DepartmentStore_4F_Items::
 	.2byte ITEM_THUNDER_STONE
 	.2byte ITEM_WATER_STONE
 	.2byte ITEM_LEAF_STONE
+	.2byte ITEM_MOON_STONE
+	.2byte ITEM_SUN_STONE
+	.2byte ITEM_KINGS_ROCK
+	.2byte ITEM_METAL_COAT
+	.2byte ITEM_DRAGON_SCALE
+	.2byte ITEM_UP_GRADE
+	.2byte ITEM_DEEP_SEA_TOOTH
+	.2byte ITEM_DEEP_SEA_SCALE
 	.2byte ITEM_NONE
 	release
 	end
